{"4173820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veil of the Damned", "steam_appid": 4173820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Veil of the Damned – A Roguelite where the world watches you back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You enter the Veil not as a hero, but as a <strong>Bound Soul</strong> — <br>a being pulled into a shifting realm of fear, memory, and corruption. <br>At the threshold waits the <strong>Gatekeeper</strong>, who asks only one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“How do you feel today?”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your answer shapes your first imprint: strength, arcane focus, clarity, or speed. <br>No classes. No builds. Only the state of your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inside, the Veil becomes a presence of its own — <br>observing you, reacting to your choices, whispering through every biome, altar, battle, and mistake. <br>It reshapes you with every run, twisting your essence as you descend through <strong>7 dungeons</strong>, <br>each with <strong>multiple variants</strong>, secrets, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight, adapt, and survive long enough to confront the Nightmare that hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beyond the damned veil, face peril and plunder. <br>Master your skills to survive the labyrinth.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/1eb47ec53b805dd427303d79537f6d53.poster.avif?t=1784892998\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/1eb47ec53b805dd427303d79537f6d53.webm?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/1eb47ec53b805dd427303d79537f6d53.mp4?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Fight the creatures of the damned!</i></strong> <br>Encounter creatures from the damned realm!   <br>Zombies, wraiths, fallen ogres, death snails, and demons of all kinds await you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Survive, die, repeat until…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/f5f0ebf3f6a6940717ea6cc646d61fe0.poster.avif?t=1784892998\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/f5f0ebf3f6a6940717ea6cc646d61fe0.webm?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/f5f0ebf3f6a6940717ea6cc646d61fe0.mp4?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Navigate through the labyrinth!</strong></i><strong></strong><br><u>Find</u> the way to dig your adventure deeper into this realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/e5a0e30b8a2285039b5617f4225beb44.poster.avif?t=1784892998\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/e5a0e30b8a2285039b5617f4225beb44.webm?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/e5a0e30b8a2285039b5617f4225beb44.mp4?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Find and unlock treasures to plunder!</strong></i><br>Your success is boosted by every piece of <u>loot</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/b298a8320e78bac53153b7ec13689c1c.poster.avif?t=1784892998\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/b298a8320e78bac53153b7ec13689c1c.webm?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/b298a8320e78bac53153b7ec13689c1c.mp4?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Learn magic and techniques.</strong></i><br>Use elemental stones, secret inscriptions, and acquired abilities to <u>defy</u> the damned! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/30e6a0ade60231caf7216761146ceeb7.poster.avif?t=1784892998\" width=596 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/30e6a0ade60231caf7216761146ceeb7.webm?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/30e6a0ade60231caf7216761146ceeb7.mp4?t=1784892998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Immerse yourself in the chaos of the Veil of Damned. <br>Lean toward Strength, Will, or Dexterity.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Veil of the Damned – A Roguelite where the world watches you back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You enter the Veil not as a hero, but as a <strong>Bound Soul</strong> — <br>a being pulled into a shifting realm of fear, memory, and corruption. <br>At the threshold waits the <strong>Gatekeeper</strong>, who asks only one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>“How do you feel today?”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your answer shapes your first imprint: strength, arcane focus, clarity, or speed. <br>No classes. No builds. Only the state of your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Inside, the Veil becomes a presence of its own — <br>observing you, reacting to your choices, whispering through every biome, altar, battle, and mistake. <br>It reshapes you with every run, twisting your essence as you descend through <strong>7 dungeons</strong>, <br>each with <strong>multiple variants</strong>, secrets, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight, adapt, and survive long enough to confront the Nightmare that hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beyond the damned veil, face peril and plunder. <br>Master your skills to survive the labyrinth.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/1eb47ec53b805dd427303d79537f6d53.poster.avif?t=1784892998\" width=594 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/extras/1eb47ec