ard Strength, Will, or Dexterity.</p>", "short_description": "Enter the Veil as a Bound Soul. Master your skills and survive the labyrinth’s corruption.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/ed9ed63043569b85511ac592870eeb653619e326/header.jpg?t=1784892998", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/a4cde91efa35286459692cb58752a8ab0836a5f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784892998", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173820/a4cde91efa35286459692cb58752a8ab0836a5f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784892998", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> WindowsR 8/8.1/10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game preloads all assets before startup. Initial launch may take up to 10 seconds.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> WindowsR 8/8.1/10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo 3.0GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU / NVIDIA GeForce GTX750 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game preloads all assets before startup. Initial launch may take up to 10 seconds.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requiremen